title: 108labs-bot
excerpt: A Discord agent that holds a persistent gateway connection inside a Cloudflare Durable Object, so it runs without a server. It decides on its own when a message deserves a reply, links a person across accounts, and stores what it learns in a bi-temporal graph that records both when something was true and when we came to believe it.
